{"code": 200, "message": "获取成功，开源地址 https://github.com/vikiboss/60s，反馈群 595941841", "data": [{"rank": 1, "title": "“中国上升9位 美国下降11位”", "desc": "近日，英国“品牌金融”咨询公司发布《2026年全球软实力指数》报告，中国以评分73.5分（满分100分）在全球软实力指数中位居全球第二。而在“国际声誉”这一关键指标中，美国下降11位，中国上升9位首次超越美国。", "score": "7809757", "score_desc": "780.98w", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/1bdb5425302b543eeb5703b243e99e25", "type": "1", "type_desc": "新", "type_icon": "https://search-operate.cdn.bcebos.com/42e626c5469cc4cd3b91131bcfe53d44.png", "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%879%E4%BD%8D+%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%8B%E9%99%8D11%E4%BD%8D%E2%80%9D&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"}, {"rank": 2, "title": "中国驻菲使馆：是我们的一寸也不能丢", "desc": "3月18日，中国驻菲律宾大使馆回应南海争议称，黄岩岛是中国固有领土，“是我们的一寸也不能丢”。针对菲方炒作和非法侵闯领空行为，中方表示将依法维权，批评菲方歪曲事实、制造事端，通过媒体渲染所谓“受害者”叙事。", "score": "7714673", "score_desc": "771.47w", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/23498e790ec72673a3e3ee478372308e", "type": "1", "type_desc": "新", "type_icon": "https://search-operate.cdn.bcebos.com/42e626c5469cc4cd3b91131bcfe53d44.png", "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%A9%BB%E8%8F%B2%E4%BD%BF%E9%A6%86%EF%BC%9A%E6%98%AF%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%AF%B8%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%A2&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"}, {"rank": 3, "title": "第二艘国产大邮轮里面都有啥", "desc": "我国第二艘国产大型邮轮——“爱达·花城号”已经整装待发，这条长度超过341米、体重超14万吨的巨轮里面到底长什么样？在邮轮住哪里？吃得怎么样？哪里拍照更好看？走进“爱达·花城号”，带您抢先看国产大型邮轮的内部建造。", "score": "7619181", "score_desc": "761.92w", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/765cf609e4032dbe58894bc2fe13f6ca", "type": "0", "type_desc": null, "type_icon": null, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E8%89%98%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%A7%E5%A4%A7%E9%82%AE%E8%BD%AE%E9%87%8C%E9%9D%A2%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%89%E5%95%A5&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"}, {"rank": 4, "title": "蓝莓开始论桶卖了", "desc": "3月以来，蓝莓价格出现显著下跌，最大跌幅超过30%，吸引不少消费者前来选购。蓝莓线上销售同样火爆，在云南澄江一家种植基地，电商主播正在为自家蓝莓带货。由于价格走低，往年按小盒卖的云南花香蓝莓，今年在直播间里开始“按桶论斤销售”。", "score": "7521562", "score_desc": "752.16w", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/f58e89f62be123497649feed79ca0906", "type": "0", "type_desc": null, "type_icon": null, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%93%9D%E8%8E%93%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E8%AE%BA%E6%A1%B6%E5%8D%96%E4%BA%86&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"}, {"rank": 5, "title": "肥娟夫妇开自助健身房：月卡99元", "desc": "3月18日，“肥娟夫妇”邱智娟和丈夫林景欢发视频宣布将开健身房，称已经拿到“肥娟健身”的营业执照了，不出意外的话下个月开业。林景欢表示，次卡9.9元月卡99元，如果能帮到身边的一些人，让身体变好起来，是真的会很快乐。", "score": "7426348", "score_desc": "742.63w", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/7a32f4ca08e39f06a68b68ff3868ed57", "type": "1", "type_desc": "新", "type_icon": "https://search-operate.cdn.bcebos.com/42e626c5469cc4cd3b91131bcfe53d44.png", "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%82%A5%E5%A8%9F%E5%A4%AB%E5%A6%87%E5%BC%80%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A9%E5%81%A5%E8%BA%AB%E6%88%BF%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%88%E5%8D%A199%E5%85%83&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"}, {"rank": 6, "title": "伊朗要求阿联酋作出赔偿", "desc": "", "score": "7331017", "score_desc": "733.1w", "cover": "https://fyb-1.cdn.bcebos.com/fyb/de6163834f53ca92c1273fff98ac9078.jpeg", "type": "3", "type_desc": "热", "type_icon": "https://search-operate.cdn.bcebos.com/54a1ed72d00cd07334860b0509489d8b.png", "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BC%8A%E6%9C%97%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E9%98%BF%E8%81%94%E9%85%8B%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E8%B5%94%E5%81%BF&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"}, {"rank": 7, "title": "退休干部孤岛生活10多年：常看见蛇", "desc": "3月19日，湖南常德一退休干部孤岛独自生活10多年，常年穿长靴。该干部表示：经常看见蛇、野猪等，它们也不会伤人，看见人就跑了。", "score": "7237003", "score_desc": "723.7w", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/c06d2af9ff7cc950c0c53612b21cb9cd", "type": "0", "type_desc": null, "type_icon": null, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%80%80%E4%BC%91%E5%B9%B2%E9%83%A8%E5%AD%A4%E5%B2%9B%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB10%E5%A4%9A%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%9A%E5%B8%B8%E7%9C%8B%E8%A7%81%E8%9B%87&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"}, {"rank": 8, "title": "警方通报“路虎别停奔驰致追尾”", "desc": "3月19日，长春市公安局通报“路虎别停奔驰致追尾”事件，已将该案立为刑事案件，依法对路虎车主孙某某采取刑事强制措施，案件正进一步侦查。此前该事件曾因认定反复导致受害者吕先生近16万损失理赔无门。", "score": "7142087", "score_desc": "714.21w", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/e1f92780b85c20bfc3e3386d8a27c7a4", "type": "3", "type_desc": "热", "type_icon": "https://search-operate.cdn.bcebos.com/54a1ed72d00cd07334860b0509489d8b.png", "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%AD%A6%E6%96%B9%E9%80%9A%E6%8A%A5%E2%80%9C%E8%B7%AF%E8%99%8E%E5%88%AB%E5%81%9C%E5%A5%94%E9%A9%B0%E8%87%B4%E8%BF%BD%E5%B0%BE%E2%80%9D&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"}, {"rank": 9, "title": "中方回应英伟达对华芯片销售情况", "desc": "在3月19日商务部举行的例行发布会上，有美媒记者提问，“相关报道称中国政府已经批准了部分公司采购英伟达的H200芯片，请问是否有更多细节可以透露以及有何评论？” 商务部新闻发言人何咏前回应称：“我不了解你提到的情况。”", "score": "7046591", "score_desc": "704.66w", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/faececb84ae92ac271b638325647cfac", "type": "1", "type_desc": "新", "type_icon": "https://search-operate.cdn.bcebos.com/42e626c5469cc4cd3b91131bcfe53d44.png", "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94%E8%8B%B1%E4%BC%9F%E8%BE%BE%E5%AF%B9%E5%8D%8E%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E9%94%80%E5%94%AE%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"}, {"rank": 10, "title": "涉密人员婚假擅自出境被通报批评", "desc": "某省直单位涉密人员林某在婚假期间持旧通行证擅自赴香港游玩，返岗后未主动报备。单位核查发现后，对其作出通报批评、取消当年评先资格并上收通行证件的处分。", "score": "6944534", "score_desc": "694.45w", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/3274e02aeaa921ac797c0eadb7f660a7", "type": "0", "type_desc": null, "type_icon": null, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%B6%89%E5%AF%86%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E5%A9%9A%E5%81%87%E6%93%85%E8%87%AA%E5%87%BA%E5%A2%83%E8%A2%AB%E9%80%9A%E6%8A%A5%E6%89%B9%E8%AF%84&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"}, {"rank": 11, "title": "男子捏造散布涉企虚假信息被拘", "desc": "近日，沙某为博取关注，在网上杜撰某科技公司“裁员30%”等不实信息，造成恶劣影响，被公安机关依法行政拘留。", "score": "6854189", "score_desc": "685.42w", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/f36c4914de2b97499e1b3108a9f09533", "type": "0", "type_desc": null, "type_icon": null, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%94%B7%E5%AD%90%E6%8D%8F